model household_b
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-07
  start 2022-03-01
  end 2027-01-31
  note "Household B (tmp/cases/B): Piotr Sowa, a sole trader from 2022-04-11, and Aleksandra (Ola) Wilk, employed by Mewa; not married. One reality (L §6.1): each document is a source, its facts in versions known on the document's day (L §4.5); the record exports are observations (L §5.19)."
  note "The run is 2022-03-01 .. 2028-12-31, the days the questions reach; the mortgage's schedule to its end (2047) is a recurrence over the loan's own months and days (flat.tally). The law parts loaded with it: CC-1, CC-2, GEN-1 .. GEN-6, MOT-1, MOT-2, MTG-1, MTG-2, PIT-2 .. PIT-6, PIT-10, PIT-11, PIT-12, PIT-15, SOC-1 .. SOC-4, TT-1, TT-2, VAT-1 .. VAT-6 (tmp/design2/cases/law)."

